  "transport_limitations": [
    "GitHub.com REST and signed repository webhooks only. GitHub Enterprise and PAT credentials are unsupported.",
    "Triggers require public HTTPS ingress. Desktop and no-ingress deployments support actions only. No lossy event polling fallback.",
    "Manual installation tokens expire after one hour. Rotation requires a host resolver or delete/recreate plus trigger rebinding. Automatic token minting is unavailable.",
    "Signed-body dedupe remains subject to durable ledger retention. GitHub does not sign delivery timestamps or delivery headers.",
    "Real GitHub App installation and live webhook delivery are unverified. Owner acceptance is pending.",
    "Update actions preserve omitted fields and require at least one nonempty title, body, or explicit state change. Clearing text is unsupported."
  ],
